				<i>presaging</i> (<b>poet.</b>
			and in post - Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praesaga mali mens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 843</span></i>
			: 
